Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: The Last Tooth Clicks After Beat Three

Story & Context: The debut runs at 124 BPM. Lucía opens with one undamped quijada strike immediately after beat one. The dense early CHATTER occupies most of the first half-bar, then several isolated clicks continue into beat three. Erik keeps kick on all four quarters but mutes the hats until the last tooth stops. Daniela places one clipped Wurlitzer suspended-second chord on beat four, after CLEAR. Mateo replaces the next bar's first kick with one deep udu cavity hit. Clara enters only after two complete decay cycles with a low bass-flute fundamental that lasts less than one bar. At the midpoint, Lucía changes grip position so the same impact produces a longer THINNING phase. The tempo never changes, but Erik removes more electronic detail to give the extended decay ownership of the bar. The final quijada strike is allowed to die completely before the last sub note enters.

